## AudienceInsightsApi

### Get audience insights
## Get audience insights
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/audience_insights?audienceInsightType={{audienceInsightType}}
Accept: application/json

### Get audience insights scope and type
## Get audience insights scope and type
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/insights/audiences
Accept: application/json
